# ALLOWLIST, not a denylist.
#
# This file used to list what to leave out, so anything new at the repo root
# shipped by default. HANDOFF.md, a private planning file, once shipped this
# way and carried machine details, and it went into the .vsix for anyone to
# unzip.
#
# So: exclude everything, then name the few files the extension needs at
# runtime. A new file has to be added here deliberately before it can ship.
#
# Name FILES here, never directories. vsce expands every pattern `p` into both
# `p` and `p/**`, so a re-include of `dist/` also re-includes `dist/**` - which
# silently put the 485 KB source map, and with it the text of every source
# file, into the .vsix. Verified by running vsce, not by reasoning about it.
**

!dist/extension.js
!media/history.js
!media/history.css
!media/conflicts.js
!media/conflicts.css
!media/explorer.js
!media/explorer.css
!media/shelvesets.js
!media/shelvesets.css
!media/team-explorer.svg
!media/icon.png
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!package.json
